 units or source chronology are changed. Irregular regional resource-network display reconstruction: Don–Volga western steppe tributary plains. Settlement slots follow connected river terraces, valley branches, foothill approaches, pasture and oasis/coastal margins. Natural Earth river geometries are retained under data/geography/natural-earth-rivers.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 300 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}},"II-4B-WEST":{"points":[[41.644687,44.537373],[42.321988,44.605092],[38.905041,44.729397],[39.084329,45.1061],[40.21031,45.187265],[42.082217,44.600303],[41.156683,44.407728],[40.923351,44.715142],[40.355574,45.480561],[39.769472,44.622731],[38.334828,45.256763],[39.55682,44.903105],[39.448265,44.951017],[41.452458,45.014403],[42.005884,44.268101],[41.809646,44.209291],[41.78746,44.645588],[39.540614,45.245019],[44.119857,43.807165],[42.196678,44.205377],[40.6296,44.482422],[40.424335,44.802168],[38.534157,44.891559],[40.968665,45.500964],[41.523046,44.630039],[42.164938,43.346213],[39.057466,45.058024],[41.900309,44.878199],[37.724847,45.038197],[37.971029,45.296288],[39.903359,44.902687],[39.096421,44.867424],[42.347548,44.303221],[42.11996,44.631451],[38.72797,44.822421],[42.182712,44.461656],[42.022722,43.515718],[40.718634,44.727885],[38.203353,45.051847],[41.250921,44.80637],[39.360593,44.948542],[39.5642,45.043804],[41.798928,44.267956],[41.76558,44.14216],[41.583137,44.660302],[40.823685,45.304201],[42.200963,44.054246],[40.396425,44.456902],[38.718384,44.865427],[41.19007,45.359558],[41.632425,44.636893],[42.443353,44.571013],[39.027359,44.704232],[39.029797,45.09