lley branches, foothill approaches, pasture and oasis/coastal margins. Natural Earth river geometries are retained under data/geography/natural-earth-rivers.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 280 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}},"CEL-1A-IBERIA":{"points":[[0.34001,41.119522],[-2.683557,42.097274],[-2.98464,40.411601],[-3.219793,41.233681],[-8.064524,39.354918],[-1.773574,42.479764],[-5.689382,41.355618],[-3.477352,39.911096],[-1.426541,41.809714],[-5.810141,41.633809],[-5.493907,41.401678],[-7.416165,39.836951],[-3.798901,42.913605],[-3.093143,41.285235],[-3.311883,42.656611],[-2.968069,41.759017],[-0.665702,41.790001],[-6.864867,40.954775],[-4.714998,39.819751],[-0.237353,41.122345],[-7.011843,41.274124],[-1.821374,40.677844],[-4.108236,41.324408],[-2.662347,42.65726],[-4.850593,41.327332],[-2.672502,40.264941],[-4.443139,41.761515],[0.440213,41.381911],[-7.775475,40.951678],[-7.083101,39.86344],[-2.277076,41.713381],[-3.352826,40.201071],[-2.599972,41.764922],[-6.148189,41.392853],[-6.282437,41.636624],[-1.701145,40.934604],[-4.943391,41.449638],[-7.965158,39.66332],[-3.429037,42.966891],[-4.562814,40.120476],[-2.950245,42.453832],[-3.520327,41.820785],[-0.22631,41.484758],[-7.424536,41.028221],[-6.246996,39.960532],[0.106266,41.241817],[-7.360706,41.298961],[-2.277116,40.637111],[-3.53939,41.351397],[-5.523029,41.337822],[-1.664036,41.997066],[-5.307756,41.698698],[-6.815155,39.661629],[-4.144184,43.186505],[-2.689431,41.389553],[-3.888588,40.066655],[-3.694935,42.754394],[-2.77347,41.700123],[-1.002727,41.915096],[-6.500765,41.098362],[-4.390027,41.473744],[-8.451894,39.63056],[-2.9496