hill approaches, pasture and oasis/coastal margins. Natural Earth river geometries are retained under data/geography/natural-earth-rivers.source.geojson; smaller reference corridors remain explicitly reconstructed. Variable-width ribbons replace filled compact basin patches, and active channel cores / declared unsuitable patches / open water are excluded from terminal placement. Post-arrival dispersal takes 300 modeled calendar years along the supplied land-checked path; these are display assumptions, not source arrival dates or observed settlements. Path and dates are reconstructed."}},"CEL-1A-ITALY":{"points":[[10.733341,45.370409],[11.543362,45.126019],[8.92306,45.714136],[11.412854,46.50973],[8.070569,45.069983],[11.552741,45.253591],[8.816761,45.30422],[10.241987,44.817028],[11.49645,44.958048],[7.699006,45.105511],[9.339463,45.195442],[8.741173,46.629704],[7.416951,45.002823],[11.210627,45.870431],[10.077,44.863832],[10.828497,45.838025],[10.922445,45.168979],[9.736395,45.231417],[11.065957,44.873295],[10.876797,46.786444],[8.617149,45.0426],[7.798073,44.932992],[10.928948,46.512144],[8.266929,45.443466],[9.856105,44.979096],[11.064895,45.226505],[11.716751,45.05839],[9.031348,45.519852],[11.928785,44.830119],[11.412197,46.197512],[9.529538,44.985747],[8.404933,45.076452],[10.932239,46.246682],[9.185177,45.340362],[8.061882,45.14793],[8.773836,45.261021],[10.43855,44.887097],[10.684938,45.601055],[11.30863,45.143551],[9.003352,45.05453],[8.963525,45.028923],[7.926562,44.997663],[8.617121,45.413985],[10.048707,44.900547],[11.273188,45.097799],[12.133346,45.193096],[9.20727,45.367827],[8.743729,46.351753],[9.870073,44.91971],[10.685838,45.168529],[8.493369,45.366388],[9.526293,45.274933],[10.738436,46.801036],[8.394794,45.026776],[7.432697,44.549757],[9.102658,46.155685],[8.860107,45.180904],[11.066607,45.626337],[8.044281,45.427869],[9.619575,44.978615],[10.885369,45.357371],[11.642035,45.055321],[8.989441,45.653908],[10.307624,45.138378],[8.970612,45.364979],[